  "reference": "Kub 35",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "35",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 35"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "35",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga kuha Yakobbo omugisa ali omu kiikaro Bbeseri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.11+GEN.28.12+GEN.28.13+GEN.28.14+GEN.28.15+GEN.28.16+GEN.28.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 28:11-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga yagambira Yakobbo ati: “Imuka ogende Bbeseri, oikaleyo, oyombekereyo Ruhanga itambiro, ayakubonekiire obuwairukire mugenzi wawe Esau.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Yakobbo yagambira eka ye, n'abantu boona aba akaba anyinabo ati: “Muleke embandwa ez'abanyamahanga abamwikara nabo mweyeze, muhingise ebijwaro byanyu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nubwo twimuke tugende Bbeseri nyombekereyo Ruhanga itambiro, ayankoonyiire yanyiha omu muhito kandi ayaikaire na nyowe, hoona nambere nagendaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi baaha Yakobbo embandwa ezi boona abanyamahanga bakaba banyinazo, n'empeta ezi baajwaraga ha matu gaabo, yazisereka hansi y'omuti omweramaino ogukaba guli haihi n'ekiikaro Sekemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu bakaba nibagenda, abantu ab'omu mbuga ezikaba zibeehinguliriize, Ruhanga yabaleetera obutiini, nahabweki, tibaasobora kuhondera batabani ba Yakobbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo n'aba akaba anyinabo, baahika Luuzi, (niyo Bbeseri), enyakuli omunsi Kanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo yayombeka itambiro, ekiikaro eki, yakiruka ibara Bbeseri, habwokuba, aho nuho Ruhanga yamweyolekiire, obu akaba nairuka mugenzi we Esau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Debora ayalezire Rebbeka, yafa, baamuziika ifo ya Bbeseri harubaju rw'omuti omusisa, ekiikaro eki, nikyo kyayetiirwe Alloni-bakusi amakuru gaakyo omuti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo obu akaba naaruga Padanaramu, Ruhanga akongera yamubonekera kandi yamuha omugisa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.32.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 32:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naagamba ati: “Obaire nooyetwa Yakobbo, okuruga hati, tokyayongera kwetwa Yakobbo, baitu orayetwaga Isirairi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.4+GEN.17.5+GEN.17.6+GEN.17.7+GEN.17.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 17:4-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibara Isirairi nubwo lyatandikire, Ruhanga yamugambira ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okuzaarwa kwa Benyamiini n'okufa kwa Rakeeri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo baimukya baaruga Bbeseri, obu bakaba bali haihi okuhika Efuraate, Rakeeri yatandika kurumwa, kandi yahangirirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu akaba akyahangiriirwe, omuzaalisa yamugambira ati: “Leka kutiina habwokuba na hati noija kuzaara omwana omwojo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rakeeri obu akaba ali haihi kucwekana, yaruka omwana we ibara Benoni, baitu ise omwana, yamuruka Benyamiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rakeeri nukwo yafiire ati, yaziikwa ha muhanda ogurukutwara Efuraate (niyo Beterehemu) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ha kituuro kye, Yakobbo yasimbaho ibaale, libe kiijukyo, enyomyo egi ey'ekiijukyo ekiri ha kituuro kya Rakeeri, okuhika na hati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isirairi yayongera kugenda omumaiso, yateera eheema ye busi bwa nseeri obw'omunaara ogwa Ederi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.49.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 49:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isirairi obu akaba akyali omunsi egi, omutabani Rubbeni yagenda yabyama n'omuzaana wa ise ibara lye Beriha, eki Isirairi yakimanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaana ikumi na babiri aba Yakobbo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana boona Yakobbo aba yazaire, bakahika ikumi na babiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganu nugo mabara g'abaana aba yazaireho Leeya: Rubbeni (nugwo omuzigaijo gwa Yakobbo), Simyoni, Leevi, Yuda, Isakara, na Zebburuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amabara ag'abaana aba yazaireho Rakeeri nugo ganu: Yosefu na Benyamiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amabara aga batabani ba Biriha omuzaana wa Rakeeri nugo ganu: Daani na Nafutaali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aga batabani ba Ziripa omuzaana wa Leeya, nugo ganu: Gaadi na Aseeri. Ago nugo mabara g'abatabani ba Yakobbo, abayazaaliire Padanaramu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okufa kwa Isaaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.13.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 13:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo yahikaho Isaaka ise, yamusanga omu kiikaro Mamule, ekinyakuli haihi na Kirya-araba (niyo Hebburoni), Abburahamu na Isaaka ha baikaraga. ",
          "type": "text",
